  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are deadly in combat with the pairing of melee and ranged weapons.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Sword and Pistol<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you confirm a critical hit with your melee weapon, you can make an additional attack against that opponent with your crossbow or firearm. Normal two-weapon fighting penalties apply. If you expend a use of your mythic power, you can double the critical threat range of your ranged weapon for that extra attack.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc110\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
